<title>SPAIN: Spain details avg 4.5 pct industry gas tariff cut.</title>
<headline>Spain details avg 4.5 pct industry gas tariff cut.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Industry Ministry is to propose an average cut of 4.5 percent in industrial gas tariffs, the ministry said in a statement late Thursday.</p>
<p>The new tariffs are due for approval by the cabinet, and are likely to be implemented immediately afterwards.</p>
<p>There will be price cuts of more than 10 percent for small industry consumers - those with consumption under 12,500 therms/day.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
